# Description: A delay-oriented ABC script, the strategy DELAY 4 of
# LibreLane with a maximum fanout of 10. Usage in Yosys:
# abc -script delay.abc -constr <file> -liberty <file>
&get -n
&st
&dch
&nf
&st
&syn2
&if -g -K 6
&synch2
&nf
&st
&syn2
&if -g -K 6
&synch2
&nf
&st
&syn2
&if -g -K 6
&synch2
&nf
&st
&syn2
&if -g -K 6
&synch2
&nf
&st
&syn2
&if -g -K 6
&synch2
&nf
&put
buffer -c -N 10
topo
stime -c
upsize -c
dnsize -c
